{"id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Hausdorff Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space — ZFC Top5 Hausdorff Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space — ZFC Top5 Hausdorff Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space — ZFC Top5 Hausdorff Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (open-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to \\exists U,V\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,V)\\land x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to \\exists U,V\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,V)\\land x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hausdorffness separates distinct points by disjoint open sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"